From 7b93156e204ca464bc560bda0dba1d84bb915c95 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fengshuai <shuai.feng@sunmi.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:03:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/13] feat(conversation): authorize Files drops into the
 composer

Adds authorizeDraggedReference to the session input deps and wires it from the input hub through the Host's workspace-files face, so a dropped tree row inserts its mention only after the Host re-checks the path against the target Session. The editor defers the Lexical insert until authorization settles and re-checks the draft revision.

One over-long guard line rewrapped under 140 columns; no behavior change.
